      "expect_mode": "qa",
      "answer": [
        {
          "item": "During the raid against Sukuna, Choso used Blood Meteorite to coagulate a large volume of blood into a dome shield around him and Yuji, protecting them from the explosion caused by Sukuna's Divine Flame. As the shell burned up from the heat, Choso continuously converted his cursed energy into blood to maintain it while releasing the blood oxygen inside the dome. This act ultimately saved Yuji's life, but at the cost of Choso's.",
